{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — VIP Day Wellness Design</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Focused wellness coaching for busy professionals. VIP Day packages to build habits, frameworks and actionable routines.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="split-diagonal">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="about.html">Essentials</a></li>
          <li><a href="services.html">Our Work</a></li>
          <li><a href="programs.html">Approach</a></li>
          <li><a href="pricing.html">Offerings</a></li>
          <li><a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html">Book a Day</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Connect</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <a class="cta small" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero reveal" id="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Design a clearer rhythm for busy lives</h1>
          <p class="lede">Rapid, evidence-aware coaching and a VIP Day format to create repeatable habits, decision frameworks, and a tangible plan you can use this week.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Schedule a VIP Day</a>
            <button id="tryExercise" class="btn ghost">Try a short practice</button>
          </div>
          <ul class="meta">
            <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
            <li>Serving: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-pattern" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="pattern-embed" viewBox="0 0 400 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="p1" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(25)">
                <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#f7fbf9"></rect>
                <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="3" fill="#e2f0ea"></circle>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)"></rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="diagonal-split" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery reveal" id="gallery">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Visible changes — small programs, measurable gains</h2>
        <p class="intro">Visual samples of tools and micro-routines we craft in a VIP Day. No medical promises — only repeatable daily actions and frameworks.</p>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf7f0,#f7fbfb)"></div>
            <h3>30‑minute Focus Block</h3>
            <p>Simple scaffold to build a deep-work window around your calendar constraints.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff6ea,#f8fbf7)"></div>
            <h3>Decision Filter</h3>
            <p>A three-question checklist to reduce context switching and nonessential commitments.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6eefc,#f9fbff)"></div>
            <h3>Weekly Reset Template</h3>
            <p>Action-focused review to protect momentum and update priorities each week.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="what-to-expect reveal" id="what-to-expect">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>What to expect in a VIP Day</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Clarity session:</strong> We map your immediate friction points and set one high-leverage target.</li>
          <li><strong>Rapid prototype:</strong> Build micro-habits and decide what to keep, pause or automate.</li>
          <li><strong>Systems handoff:</strong> Templates, checklists and a 30/60 day action plan you can follow independently.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="note">Outcomes focus: actionable routines, habit nudges, and durable habits — not clinical diagnosis.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objections reveal" id="objections">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Common questions</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>Is a VIP Day worth the investment?</summary>
            <p>We prioritize high-return actions you can implement immediately. Many clients leave with 2–3 routines that free up time and mental load.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What if I can't keep the routine?</summary>
            <p>We design repeatable, scalable steps and an accountability check built for your calendar and energy. Habits start small but with a clear trigger.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do you offer ongoing coaching?</summary>
            <p>Yes — optional follow-up packages and 30-minute check-ins are available to maintain momentum after the VIP Day.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta reveal" id="cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Book a focused day — transform how your days feel</h2>
        <p>One concentrated session to shape routines, clarify decisions, and create the scaffolding you need to keep pace.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Reserve your VIP Day</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Ask a quick question</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Empowered routines for professional lives.</p>
      <p class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · <a href="contact.html">Contact</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->
  <div id="exerciseModal" class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-panel" role="document">
      <button class="modal-close" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <h3 id="modalTitle">Try a short practice</h3>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p class="modal-intro">Choose a micro-practice. Each is designed to take 2–7 minutes. No equipment, no pressure.</p>
        <div class="exercise-options">
          <button class="ex-btn" data-type="breathing">Guided Breathing</button>
          <button class="ex-btn" data-type="journaling">Journaling Prompt</button>
          <button class="ex-btn" data-type="intention">Set an Intention</button>
        </div>
        <div id="exerciseArea" class="exercise-area" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
